# Project Agent Loadout — 一行一个 agent 名，# 注释
#
# 用法:
#   1. 把本文件重命名为 .enabled
#   2. 添加本项目需要的 agent 名（必须匹配 ~/.claude/agency-agents-dev/ 中 frontmatter `name:`）
#   3. 下次 Claude Code 启动时，SessionStart hook 自动从 L1.5 池复制到本目录
#
# 可用 agent 清单（44 个）查询:
#   ls ~/.claude/agency-agents-dev/
#
# 已经在 L2 全局加载的（无需在此添加）:
#   Senior Project Manager, Agents Orchestrator, Backend Architect, Frontend Developer,
#   Code Reviewer, Reality Checker, Minimal Change Engineer, Git Workflow Master
#
# L3 模板默认 11 个（已在本目录文件存在，无需在此添加）:
#   AI Engineer, Database Optimizer, Data Engineer, Incident Response Commander, SRE,
#   LSP/Index Engineer, Jira Workflow Steward, MCP Builder, Accessibility Auditor,
#   Performance Benchmarker, Test Results Analyzer

# === 示例: 取消注释你需要的 ===

# Security Engineer            # auth / token / secrets / OWASP
# API Tester                   # API 健康检查 / contract
# Evidence Collector           # UI / 浏览器证据
# DevOps Automator             # docker / CI/CD / monitoring
# Technical Writer             # 文档密集 sprint
# Codebase Onboarding Engineer # 进陌生 codebase 区
# Mobile App Builder           # iOS / Android / cross-platform
# Software Architect           # 系统级架构设计
# Rapid Prototyper             # 快速 PoC / MVP
# Senior Developer             # premium 全栈实装
